<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/32/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue of a sum not exceeding one hundred and eight billion six hundred and eighty-eight million six hundred and thirteen thousand ringgit (RM108,688,613,000) from the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2010 is hereby authorised and that sum is appropriated for purposes specified in the Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/32/eng@> .
